  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : (15 ÷ 3) × 11 + 48 − 21 × 2 + 8 = 57\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) 15 and 21\n\n(15 ÷ 3) × 11 + 48 − 21 × 2 + 8 = 57 ⇒ (21 ÷ 3) × 11 + 48 − 15 × 2 + 8 = 57\n\n⇒ __**(21 ÷ 3)**__ × 11 + 48 − 15 × 2 + 8 = 57\n\n⇒ __**7 × 11**__ + 48 − __**15 × 2**__ + 8 = 57\n\n⇒ __**77 + 48 + 8**__ − 30 = 57\n\n⇒ __**133 − 30**__ = 57\n\n<p s",
